flowchart TD
    C[Customer] -->|POST /bookings| B1[Booking: pending]
    B1 -->|Provider quote| B2[Booking: quoted]
    B2 -->|PUT /customer/bookings/id/accept-quote| B3[Booking: awaiting_payment]
    B3 -->|PUT /customer/bookings/id/pay| P1[Payment: checkout_created]
    P1 -->|Open payment_page_url| I[Iyzico Sandbox Checkout]
    I -->|Test card + callback token| CB[POST /payments/iyzico/callback]
    CB -->|Retrieve + verify amount/currency| P2{Payment result}
    P2 -->|SUCCESS| PAID[Payment: paid]
    PAID --> ACCEPTED[Booking: accepted]
    P2 -->|FAILED| FAILED[Payment: failed]
    FAILED --> B3
    ACCEPTED -->|Provider completes service| COMPLETE[Booking: awaiting_confirmation]
    COMPLETE -->|Customer confirms| DONE[Booking: completed]

    subgraph CustomerActions[Customer actions]
        C
        B2
        B3
        P1
        CB
        COMPLETE
        DONE
    end

    subgraph ProviderActions[Provider actions]
        Q[PUT /provider/bookings/id/quote]
        R[PUT /provider/bookings/id/reject]
        S[PUT /provider/bookings/id/complete]
    end

    Q --> B2
    R --> REJECTED[Booking: rejected]
    S --> COMPLETE
